  <h3>Description</h3>
  Creates an empty mono sound effect with the default sample rate.<br />
  <br />
  The sample buffer contains $Sduration@ multiplied by $SSAMPLE_PER_SECONDS@ samples. Fill sample, call $Sbunny_compute_effect@, then play the sound.<br />
